              'Use ONLY exact substrings; if a needed label is missing, omit that step. ' +
              'If you are uncertain about ui_path or steps, still include the control with ui_path="" and steps="" and needs_human=true. ' +
              'Deduplicate by control_name; include every distinct control. ' +
              'If none found, return {"controls": []}. Return ONLY valid JSON. ' +
              'Output shape (exact): {"controls":[{"control_name":"","description":"","severity":"","category":"","ui_path":"","steps":"1) ...; 2) ...; 3) ...","needs_human":false}]}' +
              '\n\nINPUT:\n<<<\n' +
